{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756080/extras/7b9d72444afa5edb25419c3d8fcc7a5f.avif?t=1754888624\" width=1600 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the story, you will play the role of the great detective Bilson, who has repeatedly solved major cases in Baotu City. However, due to a premeditated shooting, Bilson's lower body is paralyzed and he can only rely on high-tech consciousness transmission to solve cases and make a living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, this was unacceptable to the conservative and nostalgic Bilson, but in order to make a living, Bilson had to make compromises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756080/extras/dde9788a2376b53657c2f6822b566191.avif?t=1754888624\" width=1600 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game map is divided into three major areas, with Baotu City available for players to explore freely. The remaining two areas currently require triggering mission conditions to explore a small portion, but will be opened one by one in subsequent updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Baotu City</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756080/extras/d0159ebbb81b960b2ab89e363652a010.avif?t=1754888624\" width=1600 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New city</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756080/extras/21977367cd9973f1ec39dc680be3dec2.avif?t=1754888624\" width=1600 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cyber Kingdom<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756080/extras/267b1225cf0d056747808750df701019.avif?t=1754888624\" width=1600 height=768 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple career systems in the game, and players can choose any profession as a means of earning extra income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains additional games that can be launched in internet cafes on the map. Completing these additional games can also serve as a means of earning extra income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756080/extras/08115b0289146fa747295337013f9087.avif?t=1754888624\" width=1340 height=312 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3756080?t=1754888624","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3756080?t=1754888624","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756080/4c2bfeacbab6711c6804bef249024f8d93e4a81f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754888624","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756080/4c2bfeacbab6711c6804bef249024f8d93e4a81f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754888624","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756080/extras/7b9d72444afa5edb25419c3d8fcc7a5f.avif?t=1754888624\" width=1600 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the story, you will play the role of the great detective Bilson, who has repeatedly solved major cases in Baotu City. However, due to a premeditated shooting, Bilson's lower body is paralyzed and he can only rely on high-tech consciousness transmission to solve cases and make a living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, this was unacceptable to the conservative and nostalgic Bilson, but in order to make a living, Bilson had to make compromises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756080/extras/dde9788a2376b53657c2f6822b566191.avif?t=1754888624\" width=1600 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game map is divided into three major areas, with Baotu City available for players to explore freely. The remaining two areas currently require triggering mission conditions to explore a small portion, but will be opened one by one in subsequent updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragr